{"text":"And nowhere is that more important than India. Nowhere is it going to be more necessary for that foundational value to be upheld. India will succeed so long as it is not splintered along the lines of religious faith, so long as it's not splintered along any lines, and is unified as one nation. And it's when all Indians, whatever your faith, go to the movies and applaud actors like Shah Rukh Khan, and when you celebrate athletes like Milka Singh or Mary Coma, and every Indian can take pride in the courage of a humanitarian who liberates boys and girls from forced labor and exploitation who's here today, Kailash Sujati, our most recent winner of the Nobel Prize for Peace. So that's what unifies us. Do we act with compassion and empathy?","words":[{"text":"And","start":1.12,"end":1.72},{"text":"nowhere","start":1.72,"end":1.98},{"text":"is","start":1.98,"end":2.16},{"text":"that","start":2.16,"end":2.28},{"text":"more","start":2.28,"end":2.46},{"text":"important","start":2.46,"end":2.76},{"text":"than","start":2.76,"end":2.94},{"text":"India","start":2.94,"end":3.18,"punct":"."},{"text":"Nowhere","start":3.72,"end":4.08},{"text":"is","start":4.08,"end":4.3},{"text":"it","start":4.3,"end":4.4},{"text":"going","start":4.4,"end":4.48},{"text":"to","start":4.48,"end":4.54},{"text":"be","start":4.54,"end":4.64},{"text":"more","start":4.64,"end":4.8},{"text":"necessary","start":4.8,"end":5.26},{"text":"for","start":5.26,"end":5.72},{"text":"that","start":5.72,"end":6.08},{"text":"foundational","start":6.08,"end":7.02},{"text":"value","start":7.02,"end":8.38},{"text":"to","start":8.38,"end":8.74},{"text":"be","start":8.74,"end":8.92},{"text":"upheld","start":8.92,"end":9.18,"punct":"."},{"text":"India","start":11.52,"end":11.82},{"text":"will","start":11.82,"end":12.06},{"text":"succeed","start":12.06,"end":12.56},{"text":"so","start":12.56,"end":12.86},{"text":"long","start":12.86,"end":13.16},{"text":"as","start":13.16,"end":13.72},{"text":"it","start":13.72,"end":